# #298: the skip over an unplayable track is gapless. An album of three
# (playable, broken, playable; 3 s each) with Repeat All plays about five
# laps. Before, the broken track's silent failure deferred the next
# track's start until the first track's PCM had played out and the audio
# thread's 100 ms poll had seen it: the buffer ran dry for the poll phase
# plus the next start (dry=1, by=poll, lag up to ~100 ms in the trace).
# Now the next codec starts at the failure, behind the playing PCM, and
# the tick kicks the thread on the PCM's notice. Checked from the trace
# line each change writes (apps/playback.c audio_on_track_changed()):
# every change, skips included, has dry=0 (the next track's PCM was
# queued behind the last chunk: no silence), and every switch was woken
# by the tick's kick, never the poll (by=kick; typically 10-20 ms in the
# sim; the 150 ms bound leaves room for the host's load, the sim's
# kernel letting one thread run at a time, and catches the 1 s backstop
# poll). #281 kept:
# no queue stop (only one of three fails).
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-skipgap-album.script
# disk: bare
# needs: unplayable
# disk-file: build/unplayable-fixtures/skipgap1.flac Music/skipgap1.flac
# disk-file: build/unplayable-fixtures/skipgap2.flac Music/skipgap2.flac
# disk-file: build/unplayable-fixtures/skipgap3.flac Music/skipgap3.flac
# log: audio unplayable skip early run=1 skipped=1
# log: dry=0 skipped=1 by=kick
# log: dry=0 skipped=0 by=kick
# logrange: 0 0 audio tc lag_ms=\d+ fin_ms=\d+ dry=(\d+)
# logrange: 0 150 audio tc lag_ms=(\d+)
# nolog: by=poll
# nolog: : stop
# nolog: pcm underrun
# log: expect_playing ok
# golden: skip album
# timeout: 150

wait 1000
wait_db 30000
repeat all
key SELECT          # Music
wait 800
wheel +2            # Albums
wait 300
key SELECT
wait 800
key SELECT          # "Skip Gap"
wait 800
key SELECT          # its first track: the album plays from it
wait 2000           # the first track starts
expect_playing 18000    # about three laps, never stopped
shot album
quit
